<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela says will privatize CVG aluminum Jan 31.</title>
<headline>Venezuela says will privatize CVG aluminum Jan 31.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela will privatize the four aluminum companies in state holding company Corporacion Venezolana de Guayana on Jan 31, Venezuelan Investment Fund (FIV) president Alberto Poletto said.</p>
<p>&quot;That's the date we're aiming for. I hope we meet it,&quot; Poletto told Reuters.</p>
</text>
